d8cc876f: ;
;Retrieve the most recent admission date for the patient.
;DGJT initially contains the patient movement (PM) IEN from VAIP lookup.
;Sequentially finds the top-level admission IEN within the "ATS" cross-reference.
;Finally, it retrieves the zero node of that PM, which contains the admission date.
